From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:12:48 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 099/100] LM Studio: Start server when it's installed but off

Settings > AI showed LM Studio as "Not running" with install docs even
when it was installed. Now it says Server off and starts it with LM
Studio's own lms CLI in the background.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
